ISO-10303-21;
/* Pf021: CONICAL_SURFACE with near-apex EDGE_CURVE: apex vertex at Z=0, adjacent vertex at Z=1e-12 (near-zero edge); singular projection in healing produces FP exception / uninitialised-memory read; the defect entity is emitted but sits unreachable from the shape-rep root (product chain roots a GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET stub), so OCC loads only a 1-vertex stub (shape(1)); byte-present but oracle-invisible to the load-time shape-count oracles */
